@Fireworks.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Liveness. 200, Content-Type text/plain, body exactly "Healthy" — from the health check, never
### the SPA fallback (which would answer text/html).
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Current user (plan §3.4). 200 { userId, displayName, isAuthenticated: false, canWrite }.
### canWrite is true in Development (appsettings.Development.json), false in production unless
### Identity__AllowAnonymousWrites=true is set.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Unknown API path. Must be 404 — NOT 200 text/html from the SPA fallback.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/nope
Accept: application/json

### Deep link. 200 text/html (index.html) once the Angular build is in wwwroot; 404 before that.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/designer
